@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@origin = http://127.0.0.1:5173

### 先登录并通过 version.http 创建版本，设置全局 versionId。
### 将本目录 demo-screenshot.png 替换为自己的截图文件，再执行上传。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/versions/{{versionId}}/screenshots
Origin: {{origin}}
X-App-Request: museum-web
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=museum-shot

--museum-shot
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

登录界面
--museum-shot
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="demo-screenshot.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./demo-screenshot.png
--museum-shot--

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) client.global.set("screenshotId", response.body.screenshot.id);
%}

### 列表可匿名访问，多次上传后按时间正序显示
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/versions/{{versionId}}/screenshots?page=0&size=20

### 查看图片
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/screenshots/{{screenshotId}}/image
